fe in Britain. The script is written by Olivier award-winning playwright and screenwriter James Graham (Dear England, Brexit: The Uncivil War).</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/23/venice-film-festival-lineup-2026-danny-boyle">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YChoK1CQk15u6DMVEyeWSogK3c8QaqpKWxioRlW_vUUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;_oYntDzIayEC_EGp1eWbMOEWpE9t8Ux32QTHZKhXVPoƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;c9tCtPMYevHqd79Bz3QvtCQSHJZxgmBzfvZaeBLZnF8ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4ngwUhP_dzCaspdOrOzu25cTKUCCXbEyulzUP9sR_74ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;n6INNoU7AttX6hw4EwWegFMttJsQLwvFdGNEcrqAx18ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2UC5RZzYit1P3fjGWD85W_MTJwybVYYt2B8M7-JrKrwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ryrC8H7MASjiwtnT41Ca0OX3RU01PLvxevnRzrPjQN8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7Kmc_ZiZWlCSCKIpBi2jClxf2W-L7-HtE7kBOQ3lBtgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cdzpAWpTGuEVRv6t5tqJhe5kF_IdrO86WZld-GztXdEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx(urn:rmn:predicate:source-reports-summaryƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xnCWtrCWbLXsU76